OL,3,GNEWSA'I help pigeons because they
OL,4,Adeserve more kindness'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who is on a mission to raise
OL,7,Fawareness of the plight of pigeons is
OL,8,Fcampaigning for people to treat the
OL,9,Fbirds better.
OL,11,FDexter Mathurine, from Southampton, or
OL,12,FDexter the Pigeon Guy, as he is known
OL,13,Fon social media, spends his spare time
OL,14,Fhelping pigeons.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
