OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F336A1792743966
OL,1,W5j 5Qws js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'I help pigeons because they
OL,4,Adeserve more kindness'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe began by sharing information on
OL,7,FInstagram about stringfoot, which is a
OL,8,Fpainful condition that occurs when
OL,9,Fhuman hair, thread or twine becomes
OL,10,Fwrapped around a bird's toes or ankles,
OL,11,Fcausing deformities and, in some cases,
OL,12,Fleading to pigeons losing their feet or
OL,13,Feven dying.
OL,15,FIf someone finds an injured bird in
OL,16,FSouthampton, they can send Dexter a
OL,17,Fmessage, and he will either come to
OL,18,Fhelp or offer advice on what to do
OL,19,Fnext.
